62744140625, -406.30401611328125], "widgets_values": ["画面为一张时尚运动人像摄影图，背景是干净柔和的浅米白色纯色背景。\n\n一位年轻亚洲女生坐在银灰色山地自行车上，车身印有 “SHADOW” 字样。她梳着深色细脏辫，发丝向一侧飞扬，脸上佩戴白色边框运动护目镜；耳饰是简约小圆环。\n上身穿着**香芋紫 U 领运动短背心**，领口有浅白包边，胸口有小巧白色 logo；下身搭配**白色高腰百褶运动短裙**（裙内自带安全裤样式）；双手腕都戴着白色针织护腕。\n\n人物姿态：身体微微侧转，一只手搭在自行车车把，另一只手自然垂落，腿部线条舒展，整体姿态动感有活力。\n整体光影柔和均匀，风格清爽元气，兼具户外骑行、网球健身的运动感与时尚感，色彩搭配清新（紫 + 白 + 银灰），突出活力运动穿搭。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 37, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [50], "label": "输出", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [397.21112060546875, 82], "shape": 1, "pos": [2101.391845703125, 133.0961151123047], "widgets_values": [false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "input", "link": 42, "label": "输入", "type": "*", "localized_name": "input"}, {"widget": {"name": "block"}, "name": "block", "link": 41, "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "拦截"}, {"widget": {"name": "verbose"}, "name": "verbose", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "输出日志"}], "flags": {}, "id": 39, "type": "ExecutionBlocker", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ExecutionBlocker"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [51], "label": "输出", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [398.1197204589844, 82], "shape": 1, "pos": [2100.992431640625, -405.3831787109375], "widgets_values": [false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "input", "link": 48, "label": "输入", "type": "*", "localized_name": "input"}, {"widget": {"name": "block"}, "name": "block", "link": 47, "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "拦截"}, {"widget": {"name": "verbose"}, "name": "verbose", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "输出日志"}], "flags": {}, "id": 40, "type": "ExecutionBlocker", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "